<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown starts cargo companies.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown starts cargo companies.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said analyst Will Wrightson initiated coverage of two air cargo companies, Airnet Systems Inc and Atlas Air Inc, with buy ratings.</p>
<p>--  Atlas rose 3/4 to 23-5/8, and Airnet gained 1-1/4 to 16-1/4.</p>
</text>
